          "name": "Get Return Requests",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get Return Requests",
            "description": {
              "content": "📌 Get Return Request API - Overview The Get Return Request API allows users to retrieve return requests for orders based on request status, order ID, and return order ID. 📌 Filters Available: order_id – Fetch return requests for a specific order. status – Filter return requests by status. created_from - Filter return request by date of creation created_to - Filter return request by date of creation By default, return requests will be returned for the last 3 months only. The supported date format",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "sales-channel",
                "public",
                "v1",
                "tenants",
                "sellers",
                ":seller_code",
                "return_requests"
